    player "我下次会向你解释整个故事，但我需要你帮忙清理她。"

# game/scripts/Characters/ellie.rpy:176
translate chinese_simp ellie_taming_4b3ea6ce:

    # emily "Fine. I'll forget about it for now."
    emily "美好的。我暂时忘记它。"

# game/scripts/Characters/ellie.rpy:177
